OCAPI shop API call from a partner's middleware is 401ing. they've been on the integration for years and it just broke. exact request + OCAPI fault response below -- what does the spec require for auth?

curl -X GET 'https://zzrf-001.dx.commercecloud.salesforce.com/s/RefArch/dw/shop/v23_2/customers/abc12345' \
  -H 'x-dw-client-id: aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee' \
  -H 'Authorization: Bearer some-old-token-string'

response: HTTP 401
body:
{
  "fault": {
    "type": "AuthenticationFailedException",
    "message": "The access token is invalid."
  }
}

diff this against the OCAPI shop customers spec please.
